msgid "A group name must start and end with a letter, number or underscore. In between additionally spaces, dashes and dots are allowed."
msgstr "群組名稱的開頭與結尾必須是字母、數字或底線。中間另可使用空格、連字號與點。"

#: modules/univention/admin/syntax.py:3250 modules/univention/admin/syntax.py:3284
msgid "A hostname or any part of a FQDN, separated by dots, starts and ends with a letter or a digit. In between letters, digits, dashes and underscores are allowed. Only numbers are not allowed."
msgstr "主機名稱或 FQDN 中以點分隔的任一部分，開頭與結尾必須是字母或數字。中間可使用字母、數字、連字號與底線。不允許只有數字。"

#: modules/univention/admin/syntax.py:7052
msgid "A mailing list name must start and end with a letter, number or underscore. In between additionally spaces, dashes and dots are allowed."
msgstr "郵寄清單名稱的開頭與結尾必須是字母、數字或底線。中間另可使用空格、連字號與點。"

#: modules/univention/admin/syntax.py:3085
msgid "A subnet for reverse lookup consists of the first 1-3 octets of an IPv4 address (example: \"192.168.0\") or of the first 1 to 31 nibbles of an expanded (with leading zeroes and without ::-substitution) IPv6 address (example: \"2001:0db8:010\" for \"2001:db8:100::/24\")"
msgstr "反向查詢的子網路由 IPv4 位址的前 1 至 3 個八位元組組成 (例如 \"192.168.0\"),或由展開後 (補上前導零且不使用 :: 簡寫) 的 IPv6 位址前 1 至 31 個半位元組組成 (例如 \"2001:0db8:010\" 對應 \"2001:db8:100::/24\")"

